export anchor DeepForestStyle:
    number: 234
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Deep forest
    idea:
        A calm woodland workspace in layered pine greens, where projects sit
        as soft cards with growth ring meters, the week is a moss line over a
        fern dashed line, and activity follows a winding trail.
    base: dark
    palette:
        pine: #0e1d17, the page and the style sheet
        canopy: #132820, the sidebar and the top bar
        bark: #18322a, cards, tiles and panels
        understory: #1f3d33, meter tracks, the current nav tile and the search field
        line: #2f5446, card borders and dividers
        ink: #e3efe7, text and figures
        lichen: #a9c4b5, meta, labels, dates and day letters
        moss: #b5cf7a, the primary button, ring meters, this week line, links and focus
        fern: #7fb89a, the last week dashed line and trail dots
        ok: #9adbb0, On track text and check circle
        risk: #f0cf7a, At risk text and triangle
        bad: #f5a596, Behind and overdue text, crossed square and clock
    type:
        One humanist stack, Seravek, Gill Sans Nova, Ubuntu, Calibri, DejaVu
        Sans, sans-serif. Base 15px at 1.55. The greeting is 30px at 600, tile
        figures 34px at 600 with tabular numbers, section titles 19px at 600,
        card titles 16px at 600, meta 13px in lichen, and ring percentages
        13px bold.
    layout:
        A 232px canopy sidebar holds a moss leaf mark with the Brightwork
        name, the six nav links as rounded rows with Home on an understory
        tile with a moss notch, and Mara Okafor with a round initials disc at
        the foot. The main area has a canopy top bar with a pill search field,
        a round bell with a count, and a moss New project pill. Below sit the
        greeting Good morning, Mara with the date and a line reading 4 tasks
        are overdue with a clock in coral. Four rounded bark tiles show the
        figures with a small icon each, overdue in coral. Projects are a three
        column grid of bark cards, each with a 56px ring meter holding the
        percent, the name, category, a status line, tasks done and the due
        date. Last, the chart and the activity sit side by side, the chart a
        line chart by weekday with this week as a moss line over a soft moss
        area and last week as a dashed fern line, the activity a vertical
        trail with fern dots and small icons. Below 900px the sidebar becomes
        a top band with the nav wrapping in rows, cards go to one column and
        the chart and trail stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px card padding, 16px gaps in grids, 32px between sections.
    density: Airy to medium. Cards breathe, six projects fill two rows of three.
    corners: Soft. 16px cards and tiles, pill buttons and search, round rings and dots.
    borders:
        1px line on cards and tiles, none on the sidebar. The current nav tile
        has a 3px moss notch.
    shadows: One soft deep shadow under cards, 0 8px 24px of near-black at 35 percent.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 1.8px stroke sized to the text. Status uses a
        check circle, a triangle with a bang and a crossed square, always with
        the word, overdue a clock.
    focus: A 2px moss outline offset 3px with a 6px dim moss halo.
    tone: Calm and kind, such as Good morning, Mara and A steady week on the trail.
